Cell["\<\
singList is an ordered list of singularity polynomials. Entries in indexList \
are positions in that list.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1642487768,ExpressionUUID->"e159ad30-411b-470d-9b38-67b7fa814973"],

Cell["\<\
The function first builds Euler-characteristic data from sector counts, and \
by default checks the generic sector count against the regulated count.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1926924262,ExpressionUUID->"dd52cfbc-8aa3-435a-b7bd-4833426d9d37"],

Cell["The result is True, False, Indeterminate, or $Failed.", "Notes",
 CellID->1843868183,ExpressionUUID->"2420db53-df4e-4bd1-9d3b-7280a5f167be"],

Cell["The following options can be given:", "Notes",
 CellID->1353201756,ExpressionUUID->"71752d09-48ab-4121-b2d9-79d27b566022"],

